 78|recommendation         keyboard.kitty-unsupported: The terminal did not answer
 80|                       the Kitty keyboard query, so keys such as shift+enter may
 76|                       not be told apart. Fix: Use a terminal with the Kitty
 79|                       keyboard protocol, such as kitty, Ghostty, WezTerm, foot
 33|                       or iTerm2.
 78|recommendation         terminal.apple-no-osc8: Apple Terminal mishandles OSC 8
 75|                       links, so links are shown with their URL. Fix: Use a
 58|                       terminal that supports OSC 8 links.
